  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/IMG_7430.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>276 fotos en total del s&aacute;bado en la Feria Medieval de Onda, desde el concierto de campanas en la iglesia de la Asunci&oacute;n y plaza de San Crist&oacute;bal (40 fotos) hasta el espect&aacute;culo nocturno de fuego &#39;La danza de la muerte&#39; en el castillo. Se han podido celebrar todos los actos (236 fotos), a pesar de la lluvia.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtefiramedieval16/img_6887.jpg\" alt=\"img_6887\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtefiramedieval16/img_6888.jpg\" alt=\"img_6888\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtefiramedieval16/img_6889.jpg\" alt=\"img_6889\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtefiramedieval16/img_6890.jpg\" alt=\"img_6890\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtefiramedieval16/img_6891.jpg\" alt=\"img_6891\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtefiramedieval16/img_6892.jpg\" alt=\"img_6892\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtefiramedieval16/img_6893.jpg\" alt=\"img_6893\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtefiramedieval16/p1440611.jpg\" alt=\"p1440611\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtefiramedieval16/p1440613.jpg\" alt=\"p1440613\" style=\"max-width: